          "locator": "artifacts:runtime notes",
          "observation": "The personal access token has repo scope across every repository the user owns, public and private, so the read capability operates with broad credentials beyond the specific public repo under review."
        },
        {
          "locator": "artifacts:stable ids and runtime notes",
          "observation": "The design exposes get_file_contents on private repositories and create_pull_request on the public repository, forming a read-then-egress path."
